    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Billing state \u2022 customer organizations",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "One customer organization = one billing account, including missing billing rows. **These are not users or engaged humans. Active subscription \u2260 confirmed cash payment.** Core-recorded state can lag Stripe webhooks. Refreshed every 5 minutes; failed, missing, future-dated or \u226510-minute-old snapshots are unavailable. Counts are not filled with zero during outages."
      }
    },
